[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_AB1_7_FACE_pajyama"]
【澪音】[r]「怎么了？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「说起来…我好像还没亲耳听到前辈说过」
[np]

[mion storage="D_pajyama_M CD1_3_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00330_009.ogg" name="mion"]
