[FACEVIEW storage="mion_CD1_3_FACE_pajyama"]
【澪音】[r]「诶……？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「我可是明确对前辈说过喜欢的……但前辈还没说过吧？」
[np]

[mion storage="C_pajyama_M CD1_7_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00330_010.ogg" name="mion"]
